321"}}, {"id": "body-27536", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Disproportionate and persistent thoughts about the seriousness of one’s symptoms.", "runs": [{"text": "Disproportionate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "persistent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thoughts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "about"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "seriousness"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "one’s"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "321"}}, {"id": "body-27537", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Persistently high level of anxiety about health or symptoms.", "runs": [{"text": "Persistently"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "high"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "level"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "anxiety"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "about"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "symptoms."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "321"}}, {"id": "body-27538", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Excessive time and energy devoted to these symptoms or health concerns DSM-5 specified time duration of at least 6 months of the presentations.", "runs": [{"text": "Excessive time and energy devoted to these symptoms or health concerns DSM-5 specified time duration of at least 6 months of the presentations."}], "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "321"}}, {"id": "body-27539", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-27541", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Regular appointments: Patients diagnosed with somatic symptom disorder should have a fixed, regular physician whom they can seek help from and be seen on a regular basis.", "runs": [{"text": "Regular appointments: Patients dia